MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Opus review of 98941684a9: owner envelopes are now deterministic and an id already queued is
resent from its stored envelope (no request_id_conflict after a partial failure); preflight
parks only a still-unclaimed ready card; owner bodies are redacted on every path; a rejected
owner request may be re-routed once (:g2); long or substituted needs get a digest suffix;
admin covers its scope only at depth >= 3; sudo/gh builtins probe the rule/active account;
CLI --need mirrors the tool's goal_mode and wake-flag checks; config read cached 60s.
